# {{ name }}

A validated form built with ISKG. Demonstrates `Form`, the validator
set, the `Toast` helper, and several input widgets.

## Run

```bash
iskg run app.py
```

## Validators used

* `RequiredValidator` — non-empty.
* `LengthValidator(min, max)` — string length.
* `EmailValidator` — RFC-5322-ish pattern.
* `RangeValidator(min, max)` — numeric range.

## Add your own

* `URLValidator`
* `PatternValidator(regex)`
* `NumberValidator`
* `CustomValidator(fn)` — your own predicate.
